Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; =====================================================================
; Stop Windows from silently installing "manufacturer apps" for devices
; (AMD Software: Adrenalin, Realtek Audio Console, Intel/Logitech/Razer apps...)
; and downloading device icons. DRIVERS STILL INSTALL from Windows Update.
; Install any companion app you want yourself (Store / maker's site).
; Undo on an installed PC: Revert-Tweaks.ps1 -Only Drivers
; =====================================================================

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\WIM_SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\Device Metadata]
"PreventDeviceMetadataFromNetwork"=dword:00000001

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\WIM_SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Device Metadata]
"PreventDeviceMetadataFromNetwork"=dword:00000001
